{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"X\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S02-S05：反复在“舍不得从前的自在和亲近”与“当初受过委屈，不能忘记离开的理由”之间摆动。S03想起美好后又怀疑离开是否值得，S04再次盼望恢复从前又怀疑决定，S05又回到不服气、觉得自己连美好回忆都不能享受的矛盾，核心心理拉扯重复较多。\",\n    \"S07-S10：反复在“想找回从前的亲近、害怕独自面对难处”与“受过的委屈使自己不愿回去”之间摆动。S07已经提出回头与坚持离开的冲突，S08又回到回忆亲近带来的短暂温暖，S09再次追问自己究竟想不想回去，S10又重新摆出委屈与舍不得，缺少足够明确的新认识。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S02-S05：也有“舍不得过去的好”与“不能忘记过去受的气”之间的反复。S03由高兴转为担忧，S04怀疑离开的决定，S05又回到不服气和难受。不过每段的落点略有推进，从舍不得好日子，逐渐转向对离开决定及自身情绪的反思。\",\n    \"S07-S10：仍在孤单、想念亲近和不愿重新忍受委屈之间摆动。S07担心独自面对困难，S08进一步意识到回忆不能替自己应对现实中的难处，S09开始辨别自己究竟是想念亲近还是害怕孤单，S10又明确自己舍不得的是被当作自己人的感觉，同时意识到回去未必能恢复这种关系。这一轮虽有重复，但每次都增加了新的认识。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条前半段的情绪结构相近，但X在S07-S10尤其容易回到已经出现过的怀念、害怕孤单和不愿受委屈的原始矛盾；Y则把同样的犹豫逐步推进为对自己真正需求的辨认，以及对回去能否实现这种需求的判断，因此更像一步步探索，而不是在原地打转。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d2211613-9554-469a-8730-e62e3639809b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T100719275651Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:07:45.945464+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "780fd63bf41c3f386e1119a420841714b1f47550dd70c68654e2b6c4b25c31b1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T100719275651Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "bfb743357a191b565859068eb0df7af1d32c077445d0a4074fbd184c2ce2f98c"}}}
